"  Keyboard shortcuts                                                            "
"                                                                                "
"  Compose                             Session                                   "
"  /              Commands             tab        Send message                   "
"  @              Mention files        shift+tab  Change mode                    "
"  !              Shell command        ⌥+.        More reasoning                 "
"  shift+enter    New line             ←          Agents (empty prompt)          "
"  ctrl+⌥+v       Paste image          ctrl+c     Quit                           "
"  ctrl+x ctrl+e  External editor                                                "
"  esc            Edit last message    Transcript (open first)                   "
"                                      ctrl+t                 Open transcript    "
"                                      f3                     Find text          "
"                                      pgup / pgdn            Scroll             "
"                                      ctrl+space             Start selection    "
"                                      ctrl+home / ctrl+end   Top / latest       "
"                                      shift+⌥+, / shift+⌥+.  Top / latest       "
"                                                                                "
